# Optional. A free NASA API key for the solar event lookup (get one at https://api.nasa.gov).
# Copy this file to ".env.local" in this same folder and put your key after the "=" sign.
# ".env.local" is ignored by git, so the key is not uploaded. Without a key the app uses
# NASA's shared DEMO_KEY, which is rate-limited.
# Restart "npm run dev" or rebuild after changing it.
VITE_NASA_API_KEY=
